## P19 two-Broker ORDER-001 runner implementation — 2026-10-25

- Added an isolated `two-broker` Compose profile with a second pinned 5.3.4 Broker, separate store volume/config, and setup readiness that requires both `broker-a` and `broker-b`. The profile validation project `rocketmq-classic-p19-check-two-broker-20261025` listed both Brokers at `V5_3_4`; its containers, network, and volumes were removed.
